&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT IS BOX?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Box (NYSE:BOX) is the leader in Intelligent Content Management. Our platform enables organizations to fuel collaboration, manage the entire content lifecycle, secure critical content, and transform business workflows with enterprise AI. We help companies thrive in the new AI-first era of business. Founded in 2005, Box simplifies work for leading global organizations, including JLL, Morgan Stanley, and Nationwide. Box is headquartered in Redwood City, CA, with offices across the United States, Europe, and Asia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By joining Box, you will have the unique opportunity to continue driving our platform forward. Content powers how we work. It’s the billions of files and information flowing across teams, departments, and key business processes every single day: contracts, invoices, employee records, financials, product specs, marketing assets, and more. Our mission is to bring intelligence to the world of content management and empower our customers to completely transform workflows across their organizations. With the combination of AI and enterprise content, the opportunity has never been greater to transform how the world works together and at Box you will be on the front lines of this massive shift.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY BOX NEEDS YOU &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;The Events Processing team provides the foundational infrastructure for asynchronous event processing and job execution all while delivering the right data at the right time across Box! Teams rely on our services for rule evaluation and distributed job management at scale to guarantee reliable execution of their workloads, including ensuring customers&#39; files are indexed for search and converted for preview across our platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Events Platform is currently expanding into its next generation through a growing adoption by more Box products and into new use cases and we&#39;re seeking for a Software Engineer III to join our team to help shape that future. You&#39;ll have the opportunity to be a part of and collaborate across high impact teams, architect new solutions, and work with a broad and modern tech stack of cloud-native services. The work you do will have a meaningful impact for millions of users every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-pm-slice=&quot;3 3 []&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design and implement scalable services with a focus on reliability, observability, operability and efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work with cutting-edge technologies like Kubernetes, Docker, Pub/Sub, Bigtable, and Istio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Play a significant role in shaping the platform vision and defining feature roadmaps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Provide mentorship to fellow engineers and contribute to team growth and development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enhance engineering processes, principles, and culture within the team and across Box, by championing a culture of learning, continuous improvement, and blameless retrospection.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Participate in our on-call rotation, available at all times while on-call to help respond to and triage any issues that arise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO YOU ARE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;We are an AI-first company. This means you approach your work with a growth mindset and find ways to leverage AI to help make faster, smarter decisions that will 10X your impact at Box.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;Required skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have at least 3+ years of professional software development experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience building distributed services and APIs for internal backend systems in the enterprise applications space&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have a proven track record of building services and/or tooling in one or more languages (e.g., Java, Go, Scala, Python).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have experience working with message queues and/or streaming data systems like Kafka/PubSub.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to lead and deliver large projects with minimal supervision, and to work independently or as part of a larger team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preferred skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with Google Cloud Platform (GCP), Amazon Web Service (AWS) or Azure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience deploying and operating microservices on Kubernetes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Box lives its values, with community and in-person collaboration being a core part of our culture. Boxers are expected to work from their assigned office a minimum of 3 days per week.Your Recruiter will share more about how we work and company culture during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Box, we believe unique and diverse experiences benefit our culture, our products, our customers, our company, and our world. We aim to recruit a passionate, high-performing workforce that reflects the world we live in.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;If you are head-over-heels about this role but unsure if you meet all the requirements, we encourage you to apply!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability, and any other protected ground of discrimination under applicable human rights legislation. Box strives to respect the dignity and ‎‎independence of people with disabilities and is committed to giving them the same ‎‎opportunity to succeed as all other employees. Inclusiveness is core to our culture at Box, and we strive to ensure you get the most from your interview experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Box makes reasonable accommodations for applicants with disabilities. If a reasonable accommodation is needed to participate in the job application or interview process, please complete &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/5W2F6Pe3PsZNsKYp9&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-attrib-id=&quot;link-9ae9d0dd-03cc-4d6e-9884-fd6db8df7157&quot;&gt;this form&lt;/a&gt;. Reasonable accommodations may include scheduling adjustments, document dictation and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notice to applicants in Los Angeles:&amp;nbsp; Box, Inc and its related branches will consider for employment, qualified applicants with criminal histories in a manner consistent with the Los Angeles Fair Chair Ordinance.&amp;nbsp; The Fair Chance Ordinance is provided &lt;a href=&quot;https://bca.lacity.org/fair-chance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-attrib-id=&quot;link-821db4b9-b7bc-4982-b0bc-8a9984a11703&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notice to applicants in San Francisco:&amp;nbsp; Box, Inc and its related branches will consider for employment, qualified applicants with criminal histories in a manner consistent with the San Francisco Fair Chair Ordinance.&amp;nbsp; The Fair Chance Ordinance is provided &lt;a href=&quot;https://sfgov.org/olse/sites/default/files/FCO%20poster2020.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-attrib-id=&quot;link-2c0c325e-d3bd-470c-af25-4a2904f5ebb6&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For details on how we protect your information when you apply, please see our &lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.app.box.com/v/BoxPersonnelPrivacyNotice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-attrib-id=&quot;link-c1d27f0b-8ac5-4cc8-bbff-3894c8b25e2e&quot;&gt;Personnel Privacy Notice.&lt;/a&gt; If you are a California-resident, please read our California Applicant &amp;amp; Candidate Privacy Notice &lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.box.com/s/uf7c4w970ds5gpt1dufdk5bw49oym849&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-attrib-id=&quot;link-a18f4abd-1197-4e3e-8caa-81eaffb141e5&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__blocks c-message_kit__blocks--rich_text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message__message_blocks c-message__message_blocks--rich_text&quot; data-qa=&quot;message-text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer&quot; data-qa=&quot;block-kit-renderer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper--first&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Box is committed to fair and equitable compensation practices. Actual base salary (or OTE if commissionable role) is dependent upon factors such as: knowledge, skill level, experience, and work location. This role is also eligible for equity and benefits. &lt;em&gt;For more information&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;, check out our &lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.app.box.com/file/680236394456?s=3u38zhdv4gac9h0j7lmumm7arbe14yqa&quot;&gt;benefits and perks&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In accordance with OFCCP compliance, here is the &lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.box.com/s/sv4dcjqb4tfyfc456rltlucuedth4aln&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Pay Transparency Provision&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Redwood City Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$165,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$206,500 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__blocks c-message_kit__blocks--rich_text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message__message_blocks c-message__message_blocks--rich_text&quot; data-qa=&quot;message-text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer&quot; data-qa=&quot;block-kit-renderer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper--first&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;Reddit is a community of communities. It’s built on shared interests, passion, and trust, and is home to the most open and authentic conversations on the internet. Every day, Reddit users submit, vote, and comment on the topics they care most about. With 100,000+ active communities and approximately 130 million daily active unique visitors, Reddit is one of the internet’s largest sources of information. For more information, visit &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;http://www.redditinc.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://redditinc.com&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;www.redditinc.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This role is remote friendly. Reddit has a flexible first workforce.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Web Platform team leads the development of the Shreddit platform, the heart of &lt;a href=&quot;http://reddit.com&quot;&gt;reddit.com&lt;/a&gt;. We focus on platform-wide architecture, performance optimizations, operational health and upleveling our web developer experience for one of the most trafficked sites on the internet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With us, you’ll turn ambiguous platform problems into clear designs and ship high‑quality, observable, well‑tested solutions that other teams rely on every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll drive key platform initiatives, including optimizing Shreddit&#39;s global performance, evolving HTML rendering, and enhancing web infrastructure resiliency and scale. You will also boost developer experience through AI tooling, automated workflows, and streamlined CI/CD pipelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Minded Engineer: &lt;/strong&gt;You empower engineers to deliver safe, scalable, and high-performance solutions by standardizing cross-organizational patterns, workflows, and tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pragmatic Builder:&lt;/strong&gt; You strike the right balance between rapid iteration and architectural rigor, delivering scalable solutions without getting bogged down by unnecessary processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Effective Collaborator:&lt;/strong&gt; You excel in communicating complex technical concepts clearly to both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Learner:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a deep curiosity for emerging technologies and actively keep up with modern industry trends, standards, and performance optimizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build with impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and evolve the Shreddit web platform’s architecture, performance, and developer tooling that powers reddit.com for hundreds of millions of users across the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Lifecycle Development:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt; Lead end‑to‑end delivery of complex, cross‑service initiatives in areas like asset delivery, html processing, observability and reliability for core web experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality &amp;amp; Velocity:&lt;/strong&gt; Move fast while maintaining high quality standards through thorough code reviews, detailed design doc evaluations, and constructive feedback on product specs and UI mocks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship &amp;amp; Engineering Standards:&lt;/strong&gt; Help establish developer workflows, champion best practices, and mentor junior and mid-level engineers to elevate technical excellence across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Web Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong proficiency in modern web stacks, including JavaScript, TypeScript, React, and Next.js, with a proven track record of translating complex problems into performant, scalable and safe&amp;nbsp; responsive, production-grade applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Health Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience tracing, profiling and tuning performance of network calls, rendering, or data access paths, monitoring and reporting their operational health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-First Workflows Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;: Experience implementing AI workflows and tooling to support and accelerate high quality web development, optimization and debugging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;API &amp;amp; System Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated experience designing, building, and maintaining robust APIs using protocols such as REST, GraphQL, gRPC, HTTP, or Thrift basics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, a related technical field, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive Healthcare Benefits and Income Replacement Programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401k with Employer Match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Benefit programs that fit your lifestyle, from workspace to professional development to caregiving support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family Planning Support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gender-Affirming Care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental Health &amp;amp; Coaching Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Vacation &amp;amp; Paid Volunteer Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous Paid Parental Leave&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job posting may span more than one career level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to base salary, this job is eligible to receive equity in the form of restricted stock units, and depending on the position offered, it may also be eligible to receive a commission. Additionally, Reddit offers a wide range of benefits to U.S.-based employees, including medical, dental, and vision insurance, 401(k) program with employer match, generous time off for vacation, and parental leave. To learn more, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.redditinc.com/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://www.redditinc.com/careers/&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To provide greater transparency to candidates, we share base salary ranges for all US-based job postings regardless of state. We set standard base pay ranges for all roles based on function, level, and country location, benchmarked against similar stage growth companies. Final offer amounts are determined by multiple factors including, skills, depth of work experience and relevant licenses/credentials, and may vary from the amounts listed below.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The base salary range for this position is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$190,800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$267,100 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;In select roles and locations, the interviews will be recorded, transcribed and summarized by artificial intelligence (AI). You will have the opportunity to opt out of recording, transcription and summarization prior to any scheduled interviews.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;During the interview, we will collect the following categories of personal information: Identifiers, Professional and Employment-Related Information, Sensory Information (audio/video recording), and any other categories of personal information you choose to share with us. We will use this information to evaluate your application for employment or an independent contractor role, as applicable.&amp;nbsp; We will not sell your personal information or disclose it to any third party for their marketing purposes.&amp;nbsp; We will delete any recording of your interview promptly after making a hiring decision.&amp;nbsp; For more information about how we will handle your personal information, including our retention of it, please refer to our &lt;a href=&quot;https://redditinc.com/policies/candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy for Potential Employees and Contractors&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Reddit is proud to be an equal opportunity employer, and is committed to building a workforce representative of the diverse communities we serve.&amp;nbsp; Reddit is committed to providing reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities and disabled veterans in our job application procedures. If, due to a disability, you need an accommodation during the interview process, please let your recruiter know.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpaca is a US-headquartered, global leader in agent-first brokerage infrastructure&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;for stocks, ETFs, options, crypto, fixed income, 24/5 trading, and more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Amongst our subsidiaries, Alpaca is a licensed financial services company, serving hundreds of financial institutions across 40 countries with our institutional-grade APIs. This includes broker-dealers, investment advisors, wealth managers, hedge funds, and crypto exchanges, totalling over 10 million brokerage accounts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our global team is a diverse group of experienced engineers, traders, and brokerage professionals who are working to achieve our mission of opening financial services to everyone on the planet. We&#39;re deeply committed to open-source contributions and fostering a vibrant community, continuously enhancing our award-winning, developer-friendly API and the robust infrastructure behind it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpaca is proudly backed by $400 million in funding from top-tier global investors including Portage Ventures, Spark Capital, Tribe Capital, Social Leverage, Horizons Ventures, Opera Tech Ventures, SBI Group, Derayah Financial, Unbound, Peak XV, Elefund, and Y Combinator.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Team Members:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re a dynamic team of 400+ globally distributed members who thrive working from our favorite places around the world, with teammates spanning the USA, Canada, Japan, Hungary, Nigeria, Brazil, the UK, and beyond!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re searching for passionate individuals eager to contribute to Alpaca&#39;s rapid growth. If you align with our core values—Stay Curious, Have Empathy, and Be Accountable—and are ready to make a significant impact, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Software Engineer on the Platform team, you will own the technical direction of Alpaca&#39;s streaming platform - our Redpanda-based event backbone and the user-facing streaming infrastructure. Platform also owns Authentication, Developer Experience and QA, and AI-Native Engineering. Streaming is roughly two-thirds of the job and where we expect you to become the deepest engineer in the company; across the other three you review the designs, hold an informed opinion, and lead the work where they meet streaming.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a Staff role, so we are hiring for direction as much as delivery - the engineer who decides what the streaming platform looks like in two years, writes the RFC that gets three teams to agree, and then builds the hard part. We own client-facing and internal services, maintain shared libraries nearly every team depends on, and manage our own deployments. Most of our time goes into Go, but we also write Helm charts, dig through logs and metrics, and get pulled into a wide variety of problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Things You Get To Do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the architecture of our event streaming platform end to end - Redpanda, the UTS ecosystem, client libraries and user-facing streaming - and set its two-to-three-year direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the shift from batch to event-driven across Alpaca&#39;s systems, working with the teams who own them rather than around them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design user-facing streaming at scale: connection fan-out, slow consumers, backpressure, ordering and delivery guarantees, and the failure modes that only show up on a volatile market day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the standards for event-driven design - schema evolution, topic ownership, replay, idempotency - and own the shared libraries other teams build against, including the cost of versioning and deprecation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape AuthN/AuthZ direction across Alpaca and lead the work where identity meets streaming: authorizing real-time subscriptions, token lifecycle on long-lived connections, multi-tenant isolation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape how Alpaca builds with AI - the schemas, contracts and event streams you own are the substrate our agentic development platform runs on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with SRE on chaos testing and game days for the event backbone, and with our QA stream on test tooling and pre-production gates, so resilience is verified rather than assumed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead through influence rather than authority, and multiply the engineers around you through mentoring, design review, and handing off the work that grows people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join the Platform on-call rotation and act as technical lead during incidents affecting shared infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Who You Are (must-haves)&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of professional engineering experience, including several years running systems at real scale. You write Go, or have deep experience in another strongly-typed language and will pick it up quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have architected event streaming systems, not just used them - real production depth in Kafka or Redpanda across partitioning, consumer groups, rebalancing, retention and delivery guarantees, and how each breaks under load.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have delivered realtime data to clients at scale (WebSockets, SSE or gRPC streaming) and handled fan-out, slow consumers and backpressure in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have driven technical direction across team boundaries without formal authority. You can point to the decisions you owned, the RFCs you wrote, and what happened next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have built or maintained libraries many teams depend on, and know what backward compatibility and deprecation actually cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have mentored senior engineers and left the teams around you better than you found them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have real depth in at least one adjacent area - identity and access, developer tooling and CI, or testing and resilience - and genuine curiosity about the others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know Kubernetes beyond the basics: you can write a Helm chart with relative ease, you understand security best practices, and you have job experience or certifications to prove it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have worked with relational databases - we use PostgreSQL, but we are not picky as long as the fundamentals are solid.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have worked at a startup before - you thrive in ambiguous environments, embrace changing priorities, know when to balance technical debt with speed, and proactively tackle whatever needs to get done without relying on pre-existing processes or documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Who You Might Be (nice-to-haves)&lt;/h4&gt;
